      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفشّحت</span></b>  <i>She</i> (a camel) <i>parted her</i> [<i>hind</i>] <i>legs
widely;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفَاجَّتْ</span>; (K, TA;) [to be milked,
or] to stale; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فشّحت</span></b> ; (TA;) and so
